  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 2nd level, the dissident gains an intimate understanding of the roots of her struggle, allowing her to find those who suffer through similar struggles (or completely oppose it). The dissident can designate a creature she can see within 30 feet as a move action. The dissident automatically learns whether the chosen creature has a motivation that is similar to her struggle in some form.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dissident#toc11\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
